-- s 395(4A), (4B): no change in the five years preceding the first day of the financial year (1 April 2026: the window is 1 April 2021 to 31 March 2026); a change due to a relevant change of circumstance is not counted
#ASSERT `s 395(4A) the directors may change to Companies Act individual accounts for a reason other than a relevant change of circumstance` (Date 1 4 2026) EMPTY EQUALS JUST TRUE
